==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 28 seconds<sup>840f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 34 seconds<sup>1,020f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 38 seconds<sup>1,140f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Razorback]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Approach this like you would a typical [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] stage. The Relic Doge Base isn't much of a threat, as it doesn't even reach all the way to the [[Cat Base]] and attacks very slowly. Because of this, even after the Relic Doge Base's attack, you can still send in other crowd-control units to stop Razorback before he is able to push heavily. [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] with a maxed Survives [[Talents|Talent]] can really shine here thanks to her stackability. Bring enough crowd-controllers for Dark enemies ([[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]]) with a few meatshields, and this stage should be a breeze. Using [[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Mohawk Cat]] or [[Nono (Rare Cat)|Frolicking Nono CC]], both Curse-Immune [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark]] meatshields, will make it even easier.

Basically, lure the Razorbacks to your base, use Bombercats to permafreeze them, then burst them down with [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] attackers.

==Trivia==
*Since its Japanese name translates to "Cats-turned-constellations", Cats in the Stars may be a reference to myths of people and animals turning into or being memorialized as constellations. This trope is most prevalent in Greek mythology as [[wiktionary:catasterism|catasterism]]; for example, [[wikipedia:Leo (constellation)|Leo]] is said to be the [[wikipedia:Nemean Lion|Nemean Lion]], placed in the sky by Zeus after Heracles defeated it.

